{"seq":2,"slug":"selection-and-highlighting","title":"选择与高亮","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-ux/selection-and-highlighting","wordCount":1642,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"选择与高亮\">选择与高亮</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>多用户选择与高亮功能让用户能看到其他人正在选择什么——文本选择（&quot;Alice 正在编辑这段内容&quot;）、对象选择（白板/画布）、单元格选择（电子表格）。这是光标的&quot;扩展&quot;——光标是单点，选择是范围。视觉设计至关重要——半透明覆盖层 + 用户颜色 + 姓名标签，既不能遮挡内容，也不能让自己的选择受到干扰。本节介绍选择区域的渲染方式、文本选择与对象选择的区别、性能优化以及边界情况（重叠、跨元素）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选择类型</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n<th>技术实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>文本范围</td>\n<td>文档编辑</td>\n<td>编辑器 API + 渲染</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对象选择</td>\n<td>画布 / SVG</td>\n<td>边界框覆盖层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单元格</td>\n<td>电子表格</td>\n<td>单元格高亮</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区域</td>\n<td>白板</td>\n<td>框选操作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>本地选择变化到远程覆盖层渲染的链路如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[本地 selectionUpdate] --&gt; B{from 是否等于 to}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[清除 selection 状态]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[发布 from/to 到 awareness]&#10;    D --&gt; E[远程 getClientRectsForRange]&#10;    E --&gt; F[逐矩形渲染半透明覆盖层]&#10;    F --&gt; G[末尾浮动姓名标签]\">graph TD\n    A[本地 selectionUpdate] --&gt; B{from 是否等于 to}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[清除 selection 状态]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[发布 from/to 到 awareness]\n    D --&gt; E[远程 getClientRectsForRange]\n    E --&gt; F[逐矩形渲染半透明覆盖层]\n    F --&gt; G[末尾浮动姓名标签]</pre><h2 id=\"文本选择\">文本选择</h2><p><strong>捕获本地选择</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"editor.on(&#39;selectionUpdate&#39;, ({ editor }) =&gt; {&#10;  const { from, to } = editor.state.selection;&#10;  if (from === to) {&#10;    // 仅光标位置&#10;    provider.awareness.setLocalStateField(&#39;selection&#39;, null);&#10;  } else {&#10;    // 选择范围&#10;    provider.awareness.setLocalStateField(&#39;selection&#39;, { from, to });&#10;  }&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>editor.on('selectionUpdate', ({ editor }) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const { from, to } = editor.state.selection;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (from === to) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 仅光标位置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    provider.awareness.setLocalStateField('selection', null);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 选择范围</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    provider.awareness.setLocalStateField('selection', { from, to });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>渲染其他用户的选择</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"function RemoteSelection({ from, to, color, name }) {&#10;  const rects = getClientRectsForRange(editor, from, to);&#10;  return rects.map((rect, i) =&gt; (&#10;    &lt;div&#10;      key={i}&#10;      style={{&#10;        position: &#39;absolute&#39;,&#10;        left: rect.left,&#10;        top: rect.top,&#10;        width: rect.width,&#10;        height: rect.height,&#10;        backgroundColor: color,&#10;        opacity: 0.2,&#10;        pointerEvents: &#39;none&#39;,&#10;      }}&#10;    /&gt;&#10;  ));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function RemoteSelection({ from, to, color, name }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const rects = getClientRectsForRange(editor, from, to);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return rects.map((rect, i) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      key={i}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      style={{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        position: 'absolute',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        left: rect.left,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        top: rect.top,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        width: rect.width,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        height: rect.height,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        backgroundColor: color,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        opacity: 0.2,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        pointerEvents: 'none',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>视觉效果</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在选中文本上显示半透明矩形。</li>\n<li>使用用户颜色。</li>\n<li>在选择区域末尾显示姓名标签。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"tiptap-协作光标扩展\">Tiptap 协作光标扩展</h2><p><strong>用于协作编辑器</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import { CollaborationCursor } from &#39;@tiptap/extension-collaboration-cursor&#39;;&#10;&#10;const editor = useEditor({&#10;  extensions: [&#10;    StarterKit,&#10;    Collaboration.configure({ document: ydoc }),&#10;    CollaborationCursor.configure({&#10;      provider,&#10;      user: { name: &#39;Alice&#39;, color: &#39;#ff0000&#39; },&#10;      render: (user) =&gt; {&#10;        // 自定义渲染逻辑&#10;      },&#10;    }),&#10;  ],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { CollaborationCursor } from '@tiptap/extension-collaboration-cursor';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const editor = useEditor({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  extensions: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    StarterKit,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Collaboration.configure({ document: ydoc }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    CollaborationCursor.configure({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      provider,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      user: { name: 'Alice', color: '#ff0000' },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      render: (user) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 自定义渲染逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>自动渲染</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>其他用户的行内光标（插入符号）。</li>\n<li>选择区域高亮。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"对象选择-画布场景\">对象选择（画布场景）</h2><p><strong>用于白板 / Figma 类应用</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"provider.awareness.setLocalStateField(&#39;selectedIds&#39;, [&#39;shape-1&#39;, &#39;shape-2&#39;]);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>provider.awareness.setLocalStateField('selectedIds', ['shape-1', 'shape-2']);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>渲染</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"function RemoteSelectionBox({ shapeId, user }) {&#10;  const shape = shapes.get(shapeId);&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&#10;      className=&quot;selection-box&quot;&#10;      style={{&#10;        position: &#39;absolute&#39;,&#10;        left: shape.x,&#10;        top: shape.y,&#10;        width: shape.width,&#10;        height: shape.height,&#10;        border: `2px solid ${user.color}`,&#10;        pointerEvents: &#39;none&#39;,&#10;      }}&#10;    /&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function RemoteSelectionBox({ shapeId, user }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const shape = shapes.get(shapeId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      className=\"selection-box\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      style={{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        position: 'absolute',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        left: shape.x,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        top: shape.y,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        width: shape.width,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        height: shape.height,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        border: `2px solid ${user.color}`,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        pointerEvents: 'none',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>视觉效果</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>围绕图形的边框。</li>\n<li>使用用户颜色。</li>\n<li>可选的姓名标签。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"单元格选择-电子表格场景\">单元格选择（电子表格场景）</h2><p><strong>高亮单元格</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"function RemoteCellSelection({ cell, user }) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&#10;      className=&quot;cell-selection&quot;&#10;      style={{&#10;        position: &#39;absolute&#39;,&#10;        ...cellPosition(cell),&#10;        outline: `2px solid ${user.color}`,&#10;      }}&#10;    &gt;&#10;      &lt;span className=&quot;user-tag&quot; style={{ background: user.color }}&gt;&#10;        {user.name}&#10;      &lt;/span&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function RemoteCellSelection({ cell, user }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      className=\"cell-selection\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      style={{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        position: 'absolute',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ...cellPosition(cell),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        outline: `2px solid ${user.color}`,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;span className=\"user-tag\" style={{ background: user.color }}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {user.name}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>模式</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>单个单元格：使用外边框。</li>\n<li>范围选择：连续外边框。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"边界情况处理\">边界情况处理</h2><p><strong>重叠选择</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>多用户选择相同范围。</li>\n<li>视觉上叠加显示（每层半透明）。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".remote-selection {&#10;  background: var(--user-color);&#10;  opacity: 0.15; /* 多层叠加可见 */&#10;  mix-blend-mode: multiply;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.remote-selection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  background</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--user-color</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  opacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 多层叠加可见 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  mix-blend-mode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">multiply</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>跨元素选择</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>范围跨越段落/容器。</li>\n<li>使用 Range.getClientRects()（返回多个矩形）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>空选择（仅光标）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>没有选择范围。</li>\n<li>显示行内插入符号。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>换行文本</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>多行选择。</li>\n<li>多个矩形，逐一渲染。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"颜色叠加\">颜色叠加</h2><p><strong>多用户选择重叠时</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 mix-blend-mode（multiply）让颜色混合。</li>\n<li>或使用叠加外边框。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>避免</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>单层不透明覆盖遮挡内容。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"姓名标签定位\">姓名标签定位</h2><p><strong>选择范围末尾</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>跟随最后一个矩形。</li>\n<li>浮动标签。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"const lastRect = rects[rects.length - 1];&#10;return &lt;span style={{ left: lastRect.right, top: lastRect.bottom }}&gt;{user.name}&lt;/span&gt;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const lastRect = rects[rects.length - 1];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>return &#x3C;span style={{ left: lastRect.right, top: lastRect.bottom }}>{user.name}&#x3C;/span>;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>边缘回避</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>检查视口边缘。</li>\n<li>如果标签超出视口则移到内侧。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"性能优化\">性能优化</h2><p><strong>大量用户与选择区域</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>100 用户各有 10 个选择 = 1000 个覆盖层。</li>\n<li>存在性能问题。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>优化方案</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>只渲染视口内可见的。</li>\n<li>虚拟化渲染。</li>\n<li>限制显示前 10 个用户的光标，其余显示 &quot;+N 人&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"z-index-层级\">Z-index 层级</h2><p><strong>选择层在内容之上但在光标之下</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".content {&#10;  z-index: 1;&#10;}&#10;.remote-selection {&#10;  z-index: 100;&#10;}&#10;.remote-cursor {&#10;  z-index: 1000;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  z-index</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.remote-selection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  z-index</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.remote-cursor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  z-index</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>自己的选择（浏览器原生）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>不使用覆盖层渲染。</li>\n<li>使用浏览器默认选择样式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"选择同步方式\">选择同步方式</h2><p><strong>使用 CRDT</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Yjs awareness 处理临时选择状态。</li>\n<li>不持久化。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>使用 OT</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>选择信息包含在操作中（Google Docs 方式）。</li>\n<li>或使用独立通道。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>节流</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>选择变化频率比光标低。</li>\n<li>100ms 节流即可。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"无障碍设计\">无障碍设计</h2><p><strong>屏幕阅读器</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>不播报远程选择（纯视觉功能）。</li>\n<li>提供替代方案（&quot;Alice 正在编辑某段&quot;的文字提示）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>键盘用户</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>非视觉选择。</li>\n<li>状态栏文字提示。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>高对比度</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>确保在背景上可见。</li>\n<li>设置最小透明度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"现代工具支持\">现代工具支持</h2><p><strong>Liveblocks</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>内置选择同步。</li>\n<li>与 Tiptap 集成。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Tiptap CollaborationCursor</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>光标 + 选择。</li>\n<li>基于 Yjs。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Lexical（Meta）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>通过插件支持选择。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Slate</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>基于插件。</li>\n<li>自定义选择渲染。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"选择与高亮的区别\">选择与高亮的区别</h2><p><strong>选择（Selection）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用户当前正在操作的。</li>\n<li>表示编辑意图。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>高亮（Highlight/注释）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>持久化的。</li>\n<li>用于评论或标记。</li>\n<li>非临时状态。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>不同的 UX 表现</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>选择：半透明 + 用户颜色。</li>\n<li>高亮：饱和色 + 评论指示器。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"光标与选择的结合\">光标与选择的结合</h2><p><strong>常见 UX 模式</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>选择范围覆盖层。</li>\n<li>光标（插入符号）在范围的一端。</li>\n<li>两者使用相同的用户颜色。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"{selection &amp;&amp; &lt;RemoteSelectionRange ... /&gt;}&#10;&lt;RemoteCursor at={selection ? selection.to : cursor} ... /&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{selection &#x26;&#x26; &#x3C;RemoteSelectionRange ... />}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;RemoteCursor at={selection ? selection.to : cursor} ... /></span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"拖拽指示器\">拖拽指示器</h2><p><strong>显示其他用户的拖拽操作</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>光标 + &quot;拖拽中&quot;指示器。</li>\n<li>被拖对象的虚线轮廓。</li>\n<li>通过 Awareness 发布拖拽状态。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"provider.awareness.setLocalStateField(&#39;dragging&#39;, { shapeId, x, y });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>provider.awareness.setLocalStateField('dragging', { shapeId, x, y });</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"反模式\">反模式</h2><p><strong>1. 不做节流</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>选择变化频繁时性能差。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 不透明覆盖层</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>遮挡内容。</li>\n<li>应使用 0.15-0.25 的透明度。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 不使用用户颜色</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>多用户时造成混淆。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 不显示姓名标签</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无法区分是谁的选择。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 渲染所有 100 个用户</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>性能问题。</li>\n<li>应限制数量并提示 &quot;+N&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>6. 断开后选择不消失</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>残留的过期选择。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实战建议\">实战建议</h2><p><strong>1. 使用编辑器库</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tiptap / Liveblocks 已内置支持。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 0.15-0.25 透明度覆盖</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>可见但不遮挡。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. mix-blend-mode multiply</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>多层颜色叠加效果好。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 姓名标签在选择末尾</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>浮动显示。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 节流 100ms</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>不过度更新。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>6. 限制显示 10 个用户</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>保障性能。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>多用户选择与高亮让用户能看到他人正在选择的内容——包括文本范围、对象、单元格和区域。文本选择通过编辑器 selectionUpdate 事件捕获 from/to，渲染时使用 getClientRectsForRange 获取矩形并显示半透明覆盖层加姓名标签。Tiptap CollaborationCursor 扩展自动渲染光标和选择。对象选择（画布/白板）使用边界框覆盖和用户颜色边框加姓名标签。单元格选择（电子表格）使用外边框加用户标签。边界情况包括重叠（mix-blend-mode multiply 叠加）、跨元素（多矩形）、空选择（仅行内光标）、多行（多矩形逐一渲染）。颜色叠加使用 0.15 透明度加 multiply 混合模式，避免不透明遮挡。姓名标签放在最后一个矩形末尾并进行边缘回避。性能方面 100 用户 × 10 选择 = 1000 覆盖层，优化方案包括只渲染可见区域、虚拟化、限制前 10 个用户显示&quot;+N&quot;。Z-index 设置内容为 1、远程选择为 100、远程光标为 1000，自己的选择使用浏览器原生样式。选择同步使用 CRDT（Yjs awareness 临时状态）或 OT（操作中包含或独立通道），节流 100ms。选择（当前编辑意图）与高亮（持久注释评论）是不同的 UX——前者半透明用户色，后者饱和色加评论指示。光标与选择结合使用相同颜色的范围覆盖加插入符号。拖拽指示器通过 Awareness 发布拖拽状态加虚线轮廓。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"选择与高亮","id":"选择与高亮"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"文本选择","id":"文本选择"},{"level":2,"text":"Tiptap 协作光标扩展","id":"tiptap-协作光标扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"对象选择（画布场景）","id":"对象选择-画布场景"},{"level":2,"text":"单元格选择（电子表格场景）","id":"单元格选择-电子表格场景"},{"level":2,"text":"边界情况处理","id":"边界情况处理"},{"level":2,"text":"颜色叠加","id":"颜色叠加"},{"level":2,"text":"姓名标签定位","id":"姓名标签定位"},{"level":2,"text":"性能优化","id":"性能优化"},{"level":2,"text":"Z-index 层级","id":"z-index-层级"},{"level":2,"text":"选择同步方式","id":"选择同步方式"},{"level":2,"text":"无障碍设计","id":"无障碍设计"},{"level":2,"text":"现代工具支持","id":"现代工具支持"},{"level":2,"text":"选择与高亮的区别","id":"选择与高亮的区别"},{"level":2,"text":"光标与选择的结合","id":"光标与选择的结合"},{"level":2,"text":"拖拽指示器","id":"拖拽指示器"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式","id":"反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"实战建议","id":"实战建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多人光标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-ux/multiplayer-cursors"},"next":{"title":"冲突反馈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-ux/conflict-feedback"}}